+;GUN MONITORING - INTERRUPTS 20-22 CALL GUN_OPEN_LOST (BRAKE F, QUIT MESSAGE) WHEN THE GUN LEAVES THE
+;OPEN RANGE (CL_GunStrokePositionLPT 137000..142000) OR THE SUBMIT STOPS WHILE THE ROBOT MOVES INTO
